Package: simplemonitor-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: simplemonitor <root@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser
Recommends: systemd
Suggests: simplemonitor-agent
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: simplemonitor server (metrics storage, API and web UI)
 Receives metrics from simplemonitor agents over gRPC, stores them in an
 embedded time-series database and serves the web UI and API on port 8080.
 Installed in /opt/simplemonitor/server and run as a systemd service.
